# f1 = counted
# Both arms of the choice hand `value` itself over, the one as "v0, which is a text", the other as "v0, which is none": where the two meet, the join made a parameter: one value joined with itself, of which the join says no
# more than v0 says. The parameter that the text writes there is bound to v0, as a name of the ways has been.
